  "enonce_intro_markdown": "A discrete random variable $X$ has probability mass function, $f$, defined by\n\n$$f(x) = \\begin{cases} k(6 - x) & \\text{for } x = 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, \\\\ 0, & \\text{elsewhere.} \\end{cases}$$\n\nFind,",
  "groupes": [],
